# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/
/gen/schemas

# Bundled sidecars — compiled per-target by CI and named binaries/<name>-<triple>:
# topics-server (bun build --compile) and pty-bridge (cargo, from
# desktop-tauri/pty-bridge). Build artifacts, never committed.
#
# No trailing slash, on purpose. `/binaries/` only matches a DIRECTORY: a
# SYMLINK with the same name slips through and `git status` shows it as `??`.
# A dispatch worktree gets this path provisioned from the main checkout, and
# one `git add -A` would then commit a link into somebody's home directory,
# inside a public repo. The slash-less form covers directory, file and link.
/binaries
